Package: endpoint-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Enterprise Endpoint Management Maintainers
Depends: systemd, ca-certificates
Description: Enterprise Endpoint Management Agent
 Pure-Go lightweight agent daemon that communicates via outbound-only
 WebSocket to central management server for hardware/software inventory,
 remote execution, patch management, and security compliance.
